{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01783zwZQwybAWS6WZGJcW5A","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"The final decision is to remove the `group.protocol` client configuration entirely when the classic consumer group rebalance protocol is phased out, not to keep it restricted to a single value.\\\\n\\\\nSupporting facts in time order:\\\\n\\\\n- 2026-02-24T07:56:13.678000Z - KAFKA-17337's description is edited to state that `ConsumerConfig`'s default value for `group.protocol` should be changed from `CLASSIC` to `CONSUMER` for 5.0.0. This is a separate change (adjusting the default during the deprecation phase) and does not contradict the removal decision; it occurs before the removal in 6.0 and implies the config still exists in 5.0. [jira:13588764:change:22949889:0]\\\\n\\\\nWhat could not be determined: The JIRA records alone do not contain an explicit statement of the final decision on removal versus restriction; the decision is found only in the mailing-list records. No other relevant records were found.\\\\n\\\\nCould not be determined from the records: the values removal-versus-restriction, ; in the 6.0 phase, (removed: not found in the retrieved records).\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"jira:13588764:change:22949889:0\\\",\\\"jira:13588764:change:22949887:0\\\",\\\"jira:13588764:change:22949421:0\\\",\\\"jira:13641734:created\\\",\\\"mail:e437a5f929aa48c75a64ae98\\\",\\\"mail:2b8888b66b964eada5234616\\\",\\\"mail:263b0239b98e36fe0c99fba8\\\",\\\"mail:c64a83d2563f7ab1569d318f\\\",\\\"mail:627e735177597c7ef8fa2243\\\",\\\"mail:fd9d85a63c9e86b008ed8da0\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":181.176,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":16,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":null,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":null,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.00780962,\\\"input_tokens\\\":177751,\\\"output_tokens\\\":22763}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b2ddf83f-98a6-44ae-9c09-eb897cb4de77","uuid":"67a963cd-8fa2-4b